  "headline": "Sertraline hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a repack plant last classified VAI on 2025-05-27",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E9", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include sertraline hydrochloride as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites hold the same NDC 68788404503 labeled by Preferred Pharmaceuticals Inc.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Preferred Pharmaceuticals Inc. as the repack plant (FEI 3004582966).",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended 2025-05-27 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside has 8.5 days of 25 mg tablets on hand, below a two‑week buffer.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked option is to transfer 10 tablets of 25 mg from Corvale East, which has 31.1 days on hand and would retain 30 days after the move.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "This transfer requires a pharmacy director transfer request and would bring Corvale Lakeside to 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
